},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2024","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/0d00d3b1-d735-479e-93ec-9c565d948a22.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2023","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/cbdf06b6-4165-4b4a-bccc-94e2ffd614f9.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2022","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533269/74025533269.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2021","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533269/69258533269.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2020","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533269/65625533269.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2019","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533269/5332690319.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2018","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533269/5332690318.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533269/5332690317.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533269/5332690316.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533269/5332690315.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533269/5332690314.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533269/5332690313.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533269/5332690312.pdf","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Va Tech Wabag reported a strong start to FY27 with 20.8% year-over-year revenue growth and a record order book of INR 19,400 crores. The company remains net cash positive for the 14th consecutive quarter and continues to focus on an asset-light, technology-led business model. Management highlighted successful expansion into Kuwait and the UAE, alongside a healthy pipeline in the Middle East and Africa. The company maintains a positive outlook for sustained profitable growth driven by water security needs and industrial demand. Va Tech Wabag reported a 20% year-over-year revenue growth and a 26% increase in profit after tax for FY26, maintaining a net cash position of INR 950 crore.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The company expects to maintain a consolidated EBITDA margin in the range of 13% to 15%.","quote":"And there, you have seen in the last three years, we have been consistently performing on that, and our endeavor is to continue growing that more towards 15%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=73ea8f0a-1af1-47f6-8be6-cb3e084af8ec.pdf"},{"claim":"Management targets a revenue growth rate of 15% to 20% for the year.","quote":"See we have already guided for a 15% to 20% growth, Shubham, and we are confident of meeting that.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=73ea8f0a-1af1-47f6-8be6-cb3e084af8ec.pdf"},{"claim":"The company targets a revenue growth of 15% to 20% and EBITDA margins between 13% and 15%.","quote":"We said we will keep our order book at least 3x of revenues. We are at over 4x of revenues, giving a robust revenue visibility. 15% to 20% CAGR of revenue, this year we did almost 20% on the higher side of the band. EBITDA 13% to 15%, we've firmly remained in that band not just this year, but over the last 2 to 3 years.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=360d4c02-f0d2-4772-932c-157c559808f1.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"The Middle East and Africa region is a key growth engine driven by water security needs.","quote":"The MEA region continues to emerge as an important growth engine for WABAG with water security driving opportunities across desalination, wastewater treatment and reuse.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=73ea8f0a-1af1-47f6-8be6-cb3e084af8ec.pdf"},{"claim":"Management sees a healthy opportunity pipeline across target markets supported by urbanization and climate change.","quote":"Looking ahead, we see a healthy opportunity pipeline across our target markets, growing water security needs driven by urbanization, climate change, industrialization and tightening environmental standards continue to support demand for desalination and reuse, particularly in water stressed regions.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=73ea8f0a-1af1-47f6-8be6-cb3e084af8ec.pdf"},{"claim":"The company identifies a significant market opportunity in the water sector, estimating $75 billion to $100 billion over the next five to seven years.","quote":"And if you put all this together, this is almost 75 billion to 100 billion in next five to seven years is the opportunity.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=360d4c02-f0d2-4772-932c-157c559808f1.pdf"},{"claim":"New growth sectors for the company include semiconductors, solar PV cells, data centers, green hydrogen, and AI.","quote":"So these are the new five sectors which we didn't have a few years back and suddenly the focus is there.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=360d4c02-f0d2-4772-932c-157c559808f1.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"The company is an asset-light organization and does not require significant capex to take on new orders.","quote":"We are an asset-light organization. There is no capex required for taking orders.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=73ea8f0a-1af1-47f6-8be6-cb3e084af8ec.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"The company maintains a disciplined approach to order acquisition, focusing on payment security and technology fit.","quote":"We continue to maintain discipline in order acquisition, focusing on payment security, technology fit, contractual risk and returns.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=73ea8f0a-1af1-47f6-8be6-cb3e084af8ec.pdf"},{"claim":"Management expects EBITDA margins to stay within the 13% to 14% band for the current year.","quote":"But realistically, with the kind of projects we have, it is more fair to expect a 13% to 14% kind of band in this year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=73ea8f0a-1af1-47f6-8be6-cb3e084af8ec.pdf"},{"claim":"The company aims to increase the O&M segment contribution to 20% of its business to improve margins.","quote":"O&M at 17% we said that our medium-term 3 to 5-year outlook is to take it to 20% and we are working and on track from that perspective.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=360d4c02-f0d2-4772-932c-157c559808f1.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"The order book reached a historic high of INR 19,400 crores.","quote":"Our order book position reached a historic high of INR 194 billion, that is INR 19,400 crores, almost $1.8 billion, which is over four times of our revenue base, providing very strong visibility for execution over the coming quarters and years.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=73ea8f0a-1af1-47f6-8be6-cb3e084af8ec.pdf"},{"claim":"The company secured a landmark 60 MIGD SWRO desalination plant in Kuwait.","quote":"During the quarter, WABAG secured a landmark 60 MIGD SWRO desalination plant from the Ministry of Electricity Water and Renewable Energy.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=73ea8f0a-1af1-47f6-8be6-cb3e084af8ec.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"The company remained net cash positive for the 14th consecutive quarter.","quote":"Importantly, we remained net cash positive for the 14th consecutive quarter, reinforcing the strength of our balance sheet and our disciplined approach to the growth.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=73ea8f0a-1af1-47f6-8be6-cb3e084af8ec.pdf"},{"claim":"Net working capital days for the period stood at 108 days.","quote":"Net working capital days for the period stood at 108 days.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=73ea8f0a-1af1-47f6-8be6-cb3e084af8ec.pdf"},{"claim":"The board recommended a final dividend of INR 5 per share.","quote":"And in line with the performance, the board recommended a final dividend of INR 5/- per share, up from INR 4/- last year, recommended to the shareholders for approval.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=360d4c02-f0d2-4772-932c-157c559808f1.pdf"},{"claim":"The company maintains a net cash positive position of INR 950 crore.","quote":"Our net cash, excluding the investment in HAM, is INR 950 crore, because our borrowing is less or more or less close to INR 100 crores because that's the working capital we take because we don't want to break our fixed deposits.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=360d4c02-f0d2-4772-932c-157c559808f1.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Management stated there has been no material impact from geopolitical developments in the Middle East on operations.","quote":"Despite the recent geopolitical developments, we have seen no material impact on our projects, operations or underlying demand.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=73ea8f0a-1af1-47f6-8be6-cb3e084af8ec.pdf"},{"claim":"Management identified geopolitical tensions in the Gulf and raw material volatility as potential headwinds.","quote":"See, one, there is enough opportunity in the water sector, we have seen it in the last few slides. There is a huge investment India has allocated, whether it's Jal Jeevan Mission, AMRUT, Namami Gange all these initiatives the government has funded for the water sector. GCC and Africa, there is this Saudi 2030 vision, plus you know there is a FIFA World Cup which is being hosted by Saudi Arabia. That's another opportunity to invest in the infrastructure. Then new economy, we have seen the new sectors have further requirement of all this ultra-pure water and then reuse market. When you see the headwinds, we are seeing recently the geopolitical situation in Gulf area, which is trying to affect the smooth operations of this market.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=360d4c02-f0d2-4772-932c-157c559808f1.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"The company aims to achieve an ROCE of over 20% in the next couple of years.","quote":"ROCE over 20% we are getting closer to that and I'm sure in the next couple of years we will surely cross 20%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=360d4c02-f0d2-4772-932c-157c559808f1.pdf","timeframe":"next 2 years"},{"claim":"The company intends to increase the O&M segment contribution to 20% within 3 to 5 years.","quote":"O&M at 17% we said that our medium-term 3 to 5-year outlook is to take it to 20% and we are working and on track from that perspective.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=360d4c02-f0d2-4772-932c-157c559808f1.pdf","timeframe":"3 to 5 years"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":2,"kinds":["concall_transcript"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":21,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":3,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped. Skipped \u2014 concall_ppt: GeminiBusy: all Gemini models busy or out of free-tier quota right now \u2014 wait ~1 min and retry, or switch provid"}}